
1) compile: 
make

2) Bonzai Maker read files from eos. To mount eos do:
eosmount ~/eos

3) run:  
./runMyTree 

To see the different options do:  ./runMyTree -h
The configuration file is: vjets.cfg

If you want to run on the data do for ex:
./runMyTree txtFile=data/DYJetsToLL_data_v5.txt doWhat=DATA  
other options read fron the configuration file
If you want to run on the MC do for ex:
./runMyTree txtFile=data/DYJetsToLL_amcatnlo.txt doWhat=MC

Please notice that one should change not only the txtFile but also
'doWhat'.

If you chose the option 'outputDir = eos'. The output of the Bonzai 
will be stored in eos under:
/eos/cms/store/group/phys_smp/VJets/Bonzai13TeVoutput/

